&lt;p&gt;Discounted fitness memberships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-quality personal protective equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regular team events and many additional employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
