&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the UK Sales Team, you will be a key player in helping us scale our business and rolling out Shift Technology solutions to new clients in the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will focus on establishing and expanding the company’s customer-based across the UK, thus managing C-level relationships within the region&#39;s P&amp;amp;C &amp;amp; Health insurance ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing Shift in the United Kingdom and Ireland;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and implementing strategic territory plan to ensure Shift exceeds its revenue objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and exploiting new opportunities and the right customer stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing C-level relationships within the country&#39;s insurance ecosystem (federations, associations, clients, prospects, partners);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently and collaboratively strategize for solving deal-level challenges;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on and submitting proposals and contracts to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU&#39;VE GOT WHAT IT TAKES IF YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least&lt;strong&gt; 7 years&lt;/strong&gt; of successful &lt;strong&gt;B2B &lt;/strong&gt;experience selling large, complex enterprise-grade solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong network &amp;amp; understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;UK insurance ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling &lt;strong&gt;SaaS solutions&lt;/strong&gt; would be preferred;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of new business sales and evidence of winning and developing new accounts; selling of $300K and above across a multiyear contract;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are at ease with, building/qualifying/closing own sales pipelines and mobilizing internal resources to support ongoing customer opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive working in a fast pace environment and demonstrate a competitive, positive, winning attitude;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a solid understanding of demand creation, and a keen ability of negotiation skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can tailor communication to the customer’s needs with confidence, and can effectively deliver memorable presentations leveraging storytelling skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strategic thinker to systematically solve problems and hypothesize possible pain points and implicit needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are effective at networking and can identify the right customer stakeholders and build connections quickly to drive consensus for deals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can manage multiple opportunities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
